Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: wire dashboard, visits, orders screens to real
 backend

- api_client.dart: add all field-sales endpoints (assignments/me,
  executions/me/today, visits, check-in/out, skip, record-order,
  record-collection, day-close, dashboard, targets/me)
- today_dashboard_screen: real KPIs from /dashboard, today's routes,
  my targets with progress bars
- visits_screen: real visits from today's execution with GPS check-in/out,
  skip, record order, record collection
- orders_screen: record orders against active/completed visits

